{"seq":61,"slug":"diffusion-language-models","title":"扩散语言模型","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models","rating":{"composite":3.96,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"扩散语言模型-总览\">扩散语言模型·总览</h1><p>把噪声一步步还原成图像的扩散模型，能不能也用来生成文本？这个问题在 2025 到 2026 年间从学术猜想变成了工业现实：LLaDA 把扩散范式推到 8B 乃至更大规模并与 LLaMA3 同台竞争，Inception Labs 的 Mercury 成为第一个商用扩散大模型并在 H100 上跑出每秒上千 token 的吞吐。本 hub 要讲清楚的，正是这条与主流自回归 LLM 平行的技术路线：它为什么成立、靠什么架构实现、能带来哪些自回归做不到的能力，以及在真实工程里到底站在什么位置。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 沿一条递进主线展开，分四章。<strong>基础</strong>章先把范式之争说透——自回归把序列拆成从左到右的条件概率链，扩散则把整段文本看成一个可被噪声破坏、再被并行还原的整体；随后给出离散扩散的数学骨架与掩码去噪这一具体训练目标。<strong>架构</strong>章落到三条真实技术路线：D3PM 用转移矩阵与吸收态把扩散搬进离散空间，SEDD 用得分熵把连续扩散的得分匹配推广到离散域，连续嵌入空间扩散则反其道把 token 投到连续向量上做扩散。<strong>能力</strong>章讲扩散范式独有的能力面：一次解码多个位置的并行采样、天然支持任意顺序的可控填空、以及在数独与路径规划这类全局约束任务上对自回归的反超。<strong>实践</strong>章回到工程：2026 年的规模化现状（LLaDA、iLLaDA、Dream、Mercury）、如何与自回归做公平对比、以及 KV 缓存缺失、似然差距等仍未解决的开放挑战。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>要划清。隔壁 <a href=\"../diffusion-models/\">扩散模型</a> 讲的是图像/视频的连续扩散（DDPM、score SDE、U-Net），那是本 hub 范式的母体，但本 hub 只在「与文本的差异」这一层引用它，绝不重复推导连续扩散本身。自回归 LLM 的预训练、对齐、缩放律属于 <a href=\"../llm-fundamentals/\">LLM 基础</a>，本 hub 把它当作对照基线而非讲解对象。与扩散同属「非 Transformer-自回归」替代路线的状态空间模型，见 <a href=\"../state-space-models-mamba/\">状态空间模型与 Mamba</a>；推理与测试时计算的通用方法见 <a href=\"../llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/\">LLM 推理与测试时计算</a>，本 hub 只讲扩散特有的规划能力。部署侧的 KV 缓存、连续批处理等通用机制见 <a href=\"../llm-serving-inference-systems/\">LLM 服务与推理系统</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>。如果你是做生成式 AI 的工程师、想快速判断扩散 LLM 值不值得用，直接从 <a href=\"practice/scaling-llada-2026\">规模化与 LLaDA</a> 和 <a href=\"practice/benchmarks-vs-ar\">与自回归的对比评测</a> 起步，再回头补基础。如果你是研究者或想吃透原理，按章节顺序读：先 <a href=\"foundations/ar-vs-diffusion-paradigm\">自回归与扩散范式对比</a> 建立直觉，再 <a href=\"foundations/discrete-diffusion-basics\">离散扩散基础</a> 和 <a href=\"foundations/masked-denoising-objective\">掩码去噪目标</a> 打数学底子，然后进架构章逐条对比 D3PM、SEDD 与嵌入扩散。能力章和实践章可按兴趣跳读。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：需要熟悉 Transformer 与自注意力、交叉熵与最大似然训练、以及连续扩散模型（DDPM 的前向加噪与反向去噪）的基本直觉。不需要测度论或随机微分方程的严格背景——本 hub 在用到连续时间马尔可夫链时会给出可操作的解释而非完整证明。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ar-vs-diffusion-paradigm","title":"自回归与扩散范式对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/foundations/ar-vs-diffusion-paradigm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"discrete-diffusion-basics","title":"离散扩散基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/foundations/discrete-diffusion-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"masked-denoising-objective","title":"掩码去噪目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/foundations/masked-denoising-objective"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architectures","title":"架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"d3pm-absorbing-state","title":"D3PM 与吸收态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures/d3pm-absorbing-state"},{"seq":2,"slug":"score-entropy-sedd","title":"SEDD 与得分熵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures/score-entropy-sedd"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-embedding-diffusion","title":"连续嵌入空间扩散","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures/continuous-embedding-diffusion"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"capabilities","title":"能力","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/capabilities","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-decoding-sampling","title":"并行解码与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/capabilities/parallel-decoding-sampling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"controllable-infilling","title":"可控生成与填空","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/capabilities/controllable-infilling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reasoning-planning","title":"推理与规划能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/capabilities/reasoning-planning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scaling-llada-2026","title":"规模化与 LLaDA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/practice/scaling-llada-2026"},{"seq":2,"slug":"benchmarks-vs-ar","title":"与自回归的对比评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/practice/benchmarks-vs-ar"},{"seq":3,"slug":"open-challenges","title":"开放挑战与前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/practice/open-challenges"}]}]}